OL,3,GNEWSABoat found partially sunk off
OL,4,AOrkney weeks after fishing crew went
OL,5,Amissing
OL,6,
OL,7,FA boat has been seen partially sunk off
OL,8,FOrkney a month after a fishing crew and
OL,9,Ftheir vessel went missing north of the
OL,10,FIsle of Lewis.
OL,12,FThree men were on board the Kilda when
OL,13,Fit went missing on 13 October.
OL,15,FThe body of crew member Douglas Craigie
OL,16,Fwas found by search teams the following
OL,17,Fday but two other men - Norman Murray
OL,18,Fand Murdo Morrison - remain unaccounted
OL,19,Ffor.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
