OL,3,GNEWSABoat found partially sunk off
OL,4,AOrkney weeks after fishing crew went
OL,5,Amissing
OL,6,
OL,7,FHM Coastguard confirmed it had received
OL,8,Fa report of a partially sunk vessel
OL,9,Feast of Orkney at about 10:30, and that
OL,10,Fno further search was required - though
OL,11,Fthe boat has not been formally
OL,12,Fidentified.
